   "sentenceId": 4,
   "he": "קִימוֹלְיָא, אָמַר רַב יְהוּדָה: שְׁלוֹף דּוֹץ. אַשְׁלָג, אָמַר שְׁמוּאֵל: שְׁאֵילְתִּינְהוּ לְכֹל נָחוֹתֵי יַמָּא, וַאֲמַרוּ לִי ״שׁוּנָאגָא״ שְׁמֵיהּ, וּמִשְׁתְּכַח בְּנוּקְבָּא דְמַרְגָּנִיתָא, וּמַפְּקִי לֵיהּ בְּרִמְצָא דְפַרְזְלָא.",
   "en": "With regard to the «cimolian earth» mentioned in the mishna, «Rav Yehuda said:» This is the earth referred to as «pull out stick in [shelof dotz].» With regard to the «eshlag» mentioned in the mishna, «Shmuel said: I asked all of the seafarers» with regard to the identity of eshlag, «and they told me» that «it is called shonana, and» can be «found in the shell of the pearl, and is removed using an iron skewer.»"
  }
